1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Pumas are large, cat-like animals which are found in America.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,500
When reports came into London Zoo that a wild puma

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,800
had been spotted forty-five miles south of London, they were not taken seriously.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,500
However, as the evidence began to accumulate,

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000
for the descriptions given by people who claimed to have seen the puma were extraordinarily similar.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,500
The hunt for the puma began in a small village

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,000
where a woman picking blackberries saw a large cat only five yards away from her.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,200
It immediately ran away when she saw it,

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:30,000
and experts confirmed that a puma will not attack a human being unless it is cornered.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,800
The search proved difficult,

11
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,000
for the puma was often observed at one place in the morning

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
and at another place twenty miles away in the evening.

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,500
Wherever it went, it left behind it a trail

14
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:45,000
of dead deer and small animals like rabbits.

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Paw prints were seen in a number of places

16
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,500
and puma fur was found clinging to bushes.

17
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:53,000
Several people complained of cat-like noises at night

18
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
and a businessman on a fishing trip saw the puma up a tree.

19
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,500
The experts were now fully convinced that the animal was a puma,

20
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,000
but where had it come from?

21
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,500
As no pumas had been reported missing from any zoo in the country,

22
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:08,000
this one must have been in the possession of a private collector and somehow managed to escape.

23
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
The hunt went on for several weeks, but the puma was not caught.

24
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,000
It is disturbing to think that a dangerous wild animal is still at large in the quiet countryside.
